"set to that height over the\n"
"ground under it, and waypoints are added in between wherever the ground "
"rises or falls enough for a straight line\n"
"to drift from it. Heights end up fixed above sea level, so the vehicle "
"needs no terrain data of its own."
msgstr ""

#: src/components/terrain/TerrainQuickActionsPanel.vue
msgid ""
"Holds one height over the seabed for the whole mission, never coming above "
"the surface. Waypoints are added\n"
"wherever the seabed rises or falls enough for a straight line to drift from "
"it, so the vehicle needs no\n"
"altimeter reading to follow it."
