#: src/components/terrain/TerrainQuickActionsPanel.vue
msgid ""
"While on, every change to the mission (moving, adding or removing "
"waypoints, reshaping or rotating a survey)\n"
"re-checks it against the terrain. Each waypoint goes back to the height you "
"planned it at and is raised only as\n"
"far as needed for the path and the returns home to keep the safety margin "
"plus the terrain model error, so\n"
"waypoints the terrain no longer needs high come back down. Lasts until you "
"leave mission planning."
msgstr ""

