#: src/components/terrain/TerrainSightPanel.vue
msgid ""
"the mission line is green where an observer sees the vehicle at its planned "
"height, orange where it flies\n"
"too low to be seen and red where no observer can see it at any height. "
"Around it, the map is clear where the\n"
"vehicle is seen even on the surface, warming to orange as it must climb to "
"be seen and red where nobody sees\n"
"it. Pointing at a color marks those stretches on the chart. For aircraft, "
"stretches out of everyone's sight\n"
"are listed in Findings."
msgstr ""

